<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Carulla supermarket chain 9-mo net up.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Carulla supermarket chain 9-mo net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombian supermarket chain Carulla SA  CRL_pBG reported the following results for January through September:</p>
<p>    Nine months 1996			Nine months 1995</p>
<p>    Net profit 3.626 billion pesos    3.000 billion</p>
<p>    Net revs 236.49 billion pesos     186.92 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating profit figure was not available.</p>
<p>-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom 571 610 7944</p>
</text>
